# Summary

=== layout: bookend

# Key Takeaways

@body

- [*Polyploidy*]{color=#24578F}: whole sets; [*aneuploidy*]{color=#935D00}: individual chromosomes
- [*Nondisjunction*]{color=#24578F}: missing or extra chromosomes in gametes
- [*Trisomy 21*]{color=#003FFF}: extra chromosome 21
- [*Screening*]{color=#24578F}: chance estimate; [*diagnostic testing*]{color=#935D00}: sample testing

